{
  "$comment": "EVM-109 AC4 (AC1, AC2, AC3): scenarios of the upload loop against a deterministic fake server (the same fake is written in TypeScript and in Kotlin). A scenario: `initialStore` (a persisted snapshot or nothing), `server`, `faults` (consumed in order of calls, across runs), `runs` (each run is `engine.run(assetId, size)`; `crashAt` kills the process at the n-th checkpoint of that run, the next run uses a new engine instance on the same store) and `final` (state of the fake server and the store). `calls` lists API and transport calls without addresses: createSession, listParts, partUrl:N, put:N, complete. Faults: effect `network` (no answer), `lost_response` (the server executes, the answer is lost), `http:<status>[:<code>]`. Server: sessions (id, key, state active|expired|aborted|completed, parts), fileState (state of the file for a NEW session), partSize, partCount, partUrlHost, partUrlContentLength, listOverride (raw ListParts answer), createId (id returned by createSession), putEtag, omitEtag (storage answers without an ETag header), completeResult. Synthetic data only.",
  "defaults": {
    "assetId": "asset-1",
    "size": 40,
    "allowedHosts": ["store.example.test"],
    "ids": ["sess-1", "key-1", "sess-2", "key-2"],
    "rng": [0.5],
    "server": {
      "partSize": 16,
      "fileState": "pending_upload",
      "partUrlHost": "store.example.test",
      "sessions": []
    },
    "uploadCalls": ["createSession", "listParts", "partUrl:1", "put:1", "partUrl:2", "put:2", "partUrl:3", "put:3", "complete"]
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "R01-fresh-upload",
      "ac": "AC1",
      "runs": [
        {
          "expect": {
            "outcome": {
              "type": "uploaded"
            },
            "calls": ["createSession", "listParts", "partUrl:1", "put:1", "partUrl:2", "put:2", "partUrl:3", "put:3", "complete"],
            "sleeps": [],
            "store": "uploaded"
          }
        }
      ],
      "final": {
        "objects": 1,
        "sessionsCreated": 1,
        "open": 0,
        "puts": {
          "1": 1,
          "2": 1,
          "3": 1
        },
        "store": "uploaded"
